  "changes": [
    "After the L4 13.11 contract, added a closed S9 nonpass blocker artifact schema and strict runtime Artifact/readonly Receipt DTOs. Artifact excludes self hash and acceptance coordinates; canonical answer SHA is locally checked. Accepting completed as a blocker, null professional fields, duplicate/unknown fields and missing artifact in receipt are refused.",
    "Fixed original assignment.AdvanceAgent Mutation.BaselineGeneration to use the real positive snapshot generation, and recheck runtime/generation inside the same original CAS. Prior events are not rewritten.",
    "Original generation 1/2/3 journal identity cases and existing legacy activation/readback/blocker-resolved surfaces pass scoped normal/race after an actual failing reproduction.",
    "Original S8 generation-2, S9 PlanReport and S9 Hook/Worker candidate/Main actual checks/final Result/ACK/cleanup regression chains pass after the producer fix.",
    "Final blocker model race additionally verifies both existing canonical RepairAssignment and manifest Assignment execution slot spellings. Registry authority remains the future reader responsibility."
  ],
